2026-08-16T11:21:57Z    [DE:Worldwide net sales and revenues] GATE critic: The 7.99% YoY uplift is on the wrong basis: it’s the median of a mixed set of full‑year and Q1/Q2/Q3 YoY figures, and it omits the most relevant Q3‑to‑Q3 data point you cited (FY2024Q3→FY2025Q3 = −9%). For a Q3 forecast you should use Q3‑only comps. Using the available Q3 comps (FY2022Q3→FY2023Q3 +12%, FY2024Q3→FY2025Q3 −9%) gives a median of about +1.5%, which would imply roughly $12,200m, not $12,978m.
