2026-08-16T11:23:04Z    [DE:Production & Precision Ag operating profit] GATE critic: The -23.96% YoY factor you applied is built from a median of mixed and, in at least one case, non-like-for-like periods—specifically the “FY2022Q1–Q3 → FY2023Q1 +26.8%” input compares nine months to a single quarter. A FY2026 Q3 operating profit should be based on Q3-to-Q3 change (or segment guidance), not a pooled median that includes a 9M→Q1 comparator. Including this invalid observation contaminates the rate and makes the 441 USDm figure wrong-basis.
