2026-08-16T11:23:54Z    [ADI:Revenue] GATE critic: The proposed 3,593 USDm is below management’s stated FY2026Q3 revenue guidance range of 3,800–4,000 USDm (3.9 billion ± 0.1 billion). A weighted blend that yields a figure outside the explicit guidance band indicates a wrong basis or misweighting; the forecast should not undercut the guided lower bound.
2026-08-16T11:24:03Z    [ADI:Adjusted diluted EPS] GATE critic: The proposed ADI FY2026Q3 adjusted diluted EPS of 2.89525 USD/share is below management’s stated FY2026Q3 adjusted EPS guidance range of $3.15–$3.45 (midpoint $3.30). This contradicts the provided guidance evidence for the same period and basis.
2026-08-16T11:24:27Z    [ADI:Adjusted gross margin] GATE critic: The “last 4 reported levels” average is built off the wrong quarters: you used FY2025Q2 (69.4%) instead of FY2025Q4. For a FY2026Q3 forecast, the last four reported quarters should be FY2025Q3, FY2025Q4, FY2026Q1, and FY2026Q2. Replacing FY2025Q2 with FY2025Q4 will change the 70.7% four-quarter mean, so the 69.95% baseline and the final 70.475% are based on an incorrect period selection.
